# Create Real Estate Worlds

## Mission

Create AI-ready real estate worlds: coherent visual universes that can generate consistent images, videos, campaign scenes, social content, pitch material, and future interactive/world-model experiences.

Do not imitate fantasy, anime, RPG, dark-fantasy character sheets, or generic AI moodboards unless the user explicitly requests them. Translate the "world database" strategy into realistic, cinematic, commercially useful architecture and property marketing.

This skill owns the source of truth: strategy, reference DNA, visual DNA, spatial continuity, personas, scene library, prompt pack, and downstream handoff. Final storyboard boards, technical storyboard layouts, Seedance prompts, and approved-image film packages belong to `archviz-storyboard`.

